{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_150_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"一、十有八年，春，王正月，晉殺其大夫胥童。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"二、庚申，晉弒其君州蒲。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"稱國以弒其君，君惡甚矣。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"三、齊殺其大夫國佐。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"四、公如晉。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"五、夏，楚子、鄭伯伐宋。宋魚石復入於彭城。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"六、公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"七、晉侯使士匄來聘。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"八、秋，杞伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"九、八月，邾子來朝。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"十、築鹿囿。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"築不志，此其志何也？山林藪澤之利，所以與民共也。虞之，非正也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"十一、己丑，公薨於路寢。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"路寢，正也。男子不絕婦人之手，以齊終也。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"十二、冬，楚人、鄭人侵宋。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"十三、晉侯使士魴來乞師。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"十四、十有二月，仲孫蔑會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、邾子、齊崔杼，同盟於虛朾。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_clt_150_18","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_150","textTraditional":"十五、丁未，葬我君成公。","sentenceOrder":18}],"overrides":{}}